  "description": "Test-only support for Solhigson projects: the census base, the census of censuses, the async test base, the build-rules census (the language version, the SDK pin and the Solhigson.Analyzers rules, read from the package root its build targets write into the test assembly), the Roslyn C# source helper and the markup scans.",
  "id": "Solhigson.Testing",
  "isPrerelease": false,
