  "packageSize": 60268,
  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/solhigson-public/solhigson.framework",
  "published": "2026-11-04T22:13:55.81Z",
  "releaseNotes": "10.1.0: BuildRulesCensusTests, the build-rules census of design K (LangVersion only in a Roslyn component, a root global.json with rollForward latestPatch, the Solhigson.Analyzers switches and reference, .editorconfig lowerings dated by a solhigson-exception comment), reading the packaged rules from SolhigsonAnalyzersRoot, which this package's build and buildTransitive targets write into the test assembly; a consumer inherits it once (explicit base call) and references Solhigson.Analyzers. 10.0.0: first release. CensusTests and CensusRuleAttribute (a census reports its flagged subjects per rule id and the base applies the project's dated solhigson-exceptions.txt), CensusOfCensusesTests (every abstract census of this package inherited exactly once, every exceptions line's rule id declared), AsyncLifetimeTestBase (set-up and a once-only tear-down over xunit v2's IAsyncLifetime), CSharpSource (the consumer repository's .cs files parsed once each through Roslyn, with their invocations and declarations), MarkupScan (a tag's closing '>', a view's inline script body and a form's posted names, over Razor and HTML).",
